4
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:46,100
An agent newsroom on Microsoft Agent Framework writes the line; a fact checker checks it.

5
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:51,200
Man Utd v Man City: every option priced live, the danger zone tracked.

6
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:54,100
